  1: # ClaudeKit Marketing
  2: 
  3: AI-powered marketing automation toolkit built on Claude Code subagent orchestration. Enables autonomous workflows for content creation, campaign management, SEO optimization, and lead generation.
  4: 
  5: **Status:** Phase 6 Complete (32 agents, 119 commands, 68 skills, 8 MCP integrations) | Production Ready
  6: **Pricing:** $99 standalone | $149 bundled with ClaudeKit Engineer
  7: 
  8: ## What is Claude Code?
  9: 
 10: Claude Code is Anthropic's official CLI that orchestrates AI agents for intelligent task automation. Learn more at [Claude Code](https://claude.com/product/claude-code).
 11: 
 12: ## Quick Start
 13: 
 14: ### Prerequisites
 15: - Claude Code installed and configured
 16: - Git and 4GB+ RAM
 17: - macOS 10.15+, Ubuntu 20.04+, or Windows 10+ with WSL
 18: 
 19: ### Installation
 20: 
 21: ```bash
 22: npm install -g claudekit-cli
 23: ck new --dir my-project --kit marketing
 24: cd my-project
 25: claude
 26: ```
 27: 
 28: ### Usage Examples
 29: 
 30: ```bash
 31: # Content creation
 32: /mkt:plan "Q1 content strategy"
 33: /mkt:content:good "landing page copy"
 34: /mkt:content:cro "optimize for conversions"
 35: 
 36: # Campaign management
 37: /mkt:campaign:email "Black Friday sequence"
 38: /mkt:brainstorm "seasonal campaign ideas"
 39: 
 40: # SEO & analysis
 41: /mkt:seo:keywords "target keyword research"
 42: /mkt:scout "analyze competitor pages"
 43: ```
 44: 
 45: **(*) Notes:** ClaudeKit Marketing has a `/mkt:` prefix in the commands to distinguish with ClaudeKit Engineer's commands.
 46: 
