 48: 
 49: - **32 Specialized Agents** - TOFU, MOFU, BOFU funnel stages + core & support roles
 50: - **119 Commands** - Content, campaigns, SEO, social, email, analytics, design, fixes
 51: - **68 Skills** - AI/multimodal, design, strategy, marketing, integrations
 52: - **8 MCP Integrations** - GA4, Google Ads, SendGrid, Discord, Slack, Resend, GSC, ReviewWeb
 53: - **6 Workflow Systems** - Campaign, content, sales, SEO, analytics, orchestration
 54: - **3 Automation Hooks** - Brand enforcement, campaign tracking, approvals
 55: - **Marketing Dashboard** - Full-stack Vue 3 app (32 components, 5 stores, production-ready)
