 181: 
 182: ```bash
 183: # Browse and install interactively
 184: gh skill install K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills
 185: 
 186: # Install a specific skill directly
 187: gh skill install K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills scanpy
