 767: ### Contribution Guidelines
 768: 
 769: ✅ **Adhere to the [Agent Skills Specification](https://agentskills.io/specification)** — Every skill must follow the official spec (valid `SKILL.md` frontmatter, naming conventions, directory structure)  
 770: ✅ Include a quoted `metadata.version` value in every `SKILL.md`  
