31: # Try in Claude Code, Claude.ai, and the API
32: 
33: ## Claude Code
34: You can register this repository as a Claude Code Plugin marketplace by running the following command in Claude Code:
35: ```
36: /plugin marketplace add anthropics/skills
37: ```
38: 
39: Then, to install a specific set of skills:
40: 1. Select `Browse and install plugins`
41: 2. Select `anthropic-agent-skills`
42: 3. Select `document-skills` or `example-skills`
43: 4. Select `Install now`
44: 
45: Alternatively, directly install either Plugin via:
46: ```
47: /plugin install document-skills@anthropic-agent-skills
48: /plugin install example-skills@anthropic-agent-skills
49: ```
50: 
51: After installing the plugin, you can use the skill by just mentioning it. For instance, if you install the `document-skills` plugin from the marketplace, you can ask Claude Code to do something like: "Use the PDF skill to extract the form fields from `path/to/some-file.pdf`"
52: 
